submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "run_log": "/workspace/output/run.jsonl"
  }
}
```

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/run.jsonl`:
JSONL, one record per sample. phase is "equilibration" or "production"; temperature is K, volume Angstrom^3 and pressure GPa.
```text
{"type":"sample","phase":"production","temperature_K":300.0,"volume_A3":1800.0,"pressure_GPa":0.000101325}
```
